/* Shared speaker records for every deck in this repo.
   Edit a person here once and both decks pick it up.

   Loaded with a plain <script src>, not fetch: fetch() on a file:// page is
   blocked by CORS, and the decks have to survive being opened straight off disk.

   Fields are a superset - each deck renders only the ones its own layout uses,
   in its own order, with its own classes. Adding a field here changes nothing
   until a deck asks for it. Strings are plain text, injected with textContent,
   so write "&" not "&amp;".

   photo: a self-contained data URI, or null when we do not have one yet. */
